{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setUserId:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSString","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"userId"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The custom user identifier (e.g., database ID, UUID)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"userId"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Associates a unique user ID with the device to:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Track users across multiple devices","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Enable user-based targeting in campaigns","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Link push engagement to user accounts in your analytics"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Support user migration between devices"}]}]}]},{"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set user ID after successful login:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class AuthenticationService {","","    func handleSuccessfulLogin(user: User) {","        \/\/ Set user ID for cross-device tracking","        Pushwoosh.configure.setUserId(user.id)","","        \/\/ Set email if available","        if let email = user.email {","            Pushwoosh.configure.setEmail(email)","        }","","        \/\/ Update user profile tags","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"logged_in\": true,","            \"login_date\": Date(),","            \"login_count\": incrementLoginCount(),","            \"account_type\": user.accountType.rawValue,","            \"subscription_status\": user.subscription?.status.rawValue ?? \"none\"","        ])","","        \/\/ Sync with analytics platforms","        Analytics.identify(user.id, traits: [","            \"email\": user.email ?? \"\",","            \"pushwoosh_hwid\": Pushwoosh.configure.getHWID()","        ])","","        Logger.info(\"User logged in: \\(user.id)\")","    }","","    func handleAccountDeletion() {","        \/\/ Clear user identity","        Pushwoosh.configure.setUserId(\"\")","","        \/\/ Clear all user data tags","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"logged_in\": false,","            \"user_id\": NSNull(),","            \"email\": NSNull(),","            \"account_deleted\": true,","            \"deletion_date\": Date()","        ])","","        \/\/ Unregister from push","        Pushwoosh.configure.unregisterForPushNotifications { _ in }","    }","}"]}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setUserId:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","title":"setUserId:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setUserId:","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setUserId:","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setuserid:"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setUserId:"},"kind":"symbol","abs